++## 3. Quick Start (Development & Prototyping)
++
++```bash
++# 1. Install dependencies
++npm install
++
++# 2. Configure environment
++cp .env.example .env
++# Edit .env and supply GEMINI_API_KEY (optional; server falls back to sovereign engine if omitted)
++
++# 3. Execute unit tests
