++/*
++Theme Name: SAHAND Theme
++Theme URI: https://sahandhaghi.site
++Author: Sahand Haghi & Engineering Team
++Author URI: https://sahandhaghi.site
++Description: Premium, multilingual, security-first WordPress theme for the SAHAND Personal Technology Hub. Features native trilingual support (Persian RTL, English LTR, Turkish LTR), CSS logical properties, high-performance typography, and decoupled architecture.
++Version: 1.0.0
++Requires at least: 6.4
++Tested up to: 6.7
